<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gadi Eisenkot is tasked with forming a new Israeli government while heavy rains flood tens of thousands of displacement tents in Gaza, damaging structures already weakened by bombings and prompting gunfire that struck tents at the Rafah site as aid teams prepare for winter storms. Israeli forces deported fourteen foreign pro-Palestinian activists arrested in the West Bank during the olive harvest and seized eight Palestinian homes in Jericho, displacing dozens of residents. A woman was killed and several people were injured when a sand embankment collapsed in Gaza. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQUXVfM2daVFlnX1daRlphVlFTYTNFS1RvVFlhSDJOZUxQdHVmZVR1eWROQVNWaFVnUEZnVzhyZG1lNms1V2FUbllMSlpXckw1VXFjT3JJcEFHTzYteThrZXpKWEtaS2dlSW5PV2NDTzJHRXZndzBhQUJ6ZVNjdmRqOWxXTFV1by1kUkFnaHVzYUhRVlprTHItNllNcGtzOFlEbVlOaGFxcU1iYlNpTTU0Ykh0eVdKVnpsZXhYQU53?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQMDdLT2JMbWtzUXB0OFJnZWl0ZDExV2xRTnlIbUZkYXFCRURPWVJQdGNvNVRXOUpua3BzQkNQLWM4TS1HeHV0d3dTd0FjeFdkWDNNbi1nVzdsdGRrSGdfYkxZb3Ryd3FSM0N6Nnc4WUtlM1VEWHloRzJiT012RHB3UURLX3VKWGVnNklQT1RGM2stUjBVa0R0VDZMbnlfS2REdUxrSUt5cXFVcWhzb2tLQjhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNSE5MY1FFODhIMDFGLXQ1Tzd1cUNfNzlFZzRmOHlPSS1ORlYzYkZ5YlFoWnYzeVRQRFFtU3VMcTZtY2tYWUhoS0xSU0FkRGVIWTNrLXJkRjNrQTd0dC1qQ0NKaTQ4TzYzVERRX3IzZHhkNFpEY21UQ0ZLeno4cFhxcDZTU0NEUy1pX1RCeEJmeHBUcjc2NzdUSmZHa1pIT2tk?oc=5&quo